meta {
  name: Update Image
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/private/images
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "url": "{{imageUrl}}",
    "alt": "Renamed photo",
    "isThumbnail": false
  }
}

docs {
  Requires an ADMIN session (run Public/Auth/Login (Admin) first). Anonymous -> 401, USER -> 403.

  The `url` in the body identifies the record (it is the primary key); the rest are the
  editable fields (alt, isThumbnail, productId, collectionId). Invalid body -> 400.
  Unknown url -> 404. Returns the updated Image record.
}
